// View function attributes can be injected into MVIR tests with
// --view-functions so the bytecode verifier sees the same metadata produced
// by source #[view] attributes.

// These cases mirror the bytecode-visible valid signatures in:
// external-crates/move/crates/move-compiler/tests/iota_mode/move_2024/typing/view_function/valid.move
// The source fixtures' native view functions are represented with regular
// aborting bodies here because arbitrary native functions fail publication
// before the IOTA metadata verifier runs.

